1
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:45,640
Dr. Jian…

2
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:50,799
What a coincidence.

3
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:51,640
You…

4
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,160
I just got off work.

5
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:55,800
Do you work out here?

6
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:58,120
Yeah.

7
00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:01,280
My clinic is upstairs.

8
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:03,000
My Taipei clinic.

9
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:17,640
- Hi.
- Hi.

10
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:19,999
Thanks for giving me a ride again.

11
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,200
Sure, It's on the way.

12
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:26,280
Let's go.

13
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:34,719
Not today.

14
00:01:34,720 --> 00:01:36,679
I haven't eaten yet.

15
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,520
Join me.

16
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:40,720
I know a good restaurant nearby.

17
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:49,560
You haven't eaten?

18
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:54,040
- Let's go.
- Okay.

19
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,200
I quit.

20
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:53,439
I…

21
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:55,680
I called, but you didn't answer.

22
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:02,280
Why didn't you go in?

23
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:10,560
Hi.

24
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:18,480
Won't look at me?

25
00:04:19,079 --> 00:04:20,640
Didn't you have fun last night?

26
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,040
Here's the proof.

27
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:28,359
Don't touch me.

28
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,440
Don't worry.

29
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:31,559
It's not contagious.

30
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:33,320
It's an immune system disorder.

31
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:36,280
Yesterday,

32
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:37,920
I saw it disappear.

33
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,919
I thought being here,

34
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:42,239
your water and air

35
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:43,360
would make me better.

36
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:45,080
But I was fooled.

37
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:47,960
The mirror lied.

38
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:49,800
Believe me?

39
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:51,519
Come, I'll show you.

40
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:53,759
- Come on.
- Let go.

41
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:56,280
See?

42
00:04:58,760 --> 00:04:59,800
It's gone.

43
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,120
It lies,

44
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:04,720
I swear.

45
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:12,520
What do you see?

46
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:16,760
Is it different from what I see?

47
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:21,639
Follow my finger.

48
00:05:21,640 --> 00:05:23,159
Don't move.

49
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,919
Good. One more time.

50
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:25,960
Here.

51
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:29,080
You're fine.

52
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:31,679
Take this for seven days,

53
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:33,160
then stop.

54
00:05:33,960 --> 00:05:35,680
Aren't they lifelong meds?

55
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:37,680
Are you a doctor?

56
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:44,000
Every child is different.

57
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:46,159
An-an's brain tests are normal,

58
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,480
so no long-term meds.

59
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:50,080
Too much medicine

60
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:52,360
can harm him.

61
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:58,400
Open your mouth.

62
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:00,040
What did he drink?

63
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:02,360
Vitamins. You forgot?

64
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:04,040
They boost immunity.

65
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:07,119
Here, your favorite.

66
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:08,039
One at a time.

67
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,600
Okay, thanks, Uncle.

68
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:11,759
An-an, let's go.

69
00:06:11,760 --> 00:06:13,160
Wait outside.

70
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:19,080
Um…is An-an okay?

71
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:21,959
Shouldn't we take him to the hospital?

72
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:22,960
No need.

73
00:06:24,080 --> 00:06:27,960
I heard the medicine is out of stock.

74
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:30,079
Don't worry.

75
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:31,519
I have a safe alternative

76
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:32,440
medication.

77
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:34,480
I know An-an's condition.

78
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:37,360
Did you tell him?

79
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:41,040
He seemed off.

80
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:51,640
The prescription's ready, didn't you hear?

81
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,720
I told her already.

82
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:25,560
Okay, let's go.

83
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:41,760
We'll get a taxi at the corner.

84
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:14,320
It's good,

85
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,280
but I think

86
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:18,080
it's the

87
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,040
water quality.

88
00:08:20,640 --> 00:08:22,519
The water here is really good,

89
00:08:22,520 --> 00:08:24,720
- everything tastes better here.
- You said you'd

90
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:28,200
tell me where Jian-cheng is.

91
00:08:33,159 --> 00:08:34,559
Come here, and I'll tell you.

92
00:08:39,559 --> 00:08:40,919
I know you're shy.

93
00:08:47,760 --> 00:08:48,760
Here goes.

94
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:52,640
Where's Yu-jhen?

95
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:55,720
Weren't you showing the studio? No keys?

96
00:08:56,400 --> 00:08:58,400
You forget everything I say.

97
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:00,680
Even left our son in the mountains.

98
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:16,520
Pretty accurate, right?

99
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:20,559
Don't look so down.

100
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:21,559
I like your smile.

101
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:22,959
It's even more beautiful

102
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:24,600
than my wife's.

103
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:28,360
Okay,

104
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,439
I'm full.

105
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:31,360
Thank you.

106
00:09:35,520 --> 00:09:36,440
By the way,

107
00:09:38,880 --> 00:09:40,680
you still don't know my name, do you?

108
00:09:41,280 --> 00:09:42,160
Want to know?

109
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:46,399
It's okay.

110
00:09:46,400 --> 00:09:47,440
Call me Jian-cheng.

111
00:09:50,680 --> 00:09:52,280
My wife will call me that

112
00:09:52,920 --> 00:09:54,680
when she comes anyway.

113
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,600
Did you two have a fight?

114
00:10:05,760 --> 00:10:07,439
Mei-ling is always like this.

115
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:09,360
That's why An-an has seizures.

116
00:10:10,920 --> 00:10:11,840
Don't blame her.

117
00:10:12,520 --> 00:10:15,200
If not her, then who? My son?

118
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,200
She's too domineering.

119
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,760
Tell me when done.

120
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:26,159
I knew you weren't Wei-zhe

121
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:27,840
from the moment I first saw you.

122
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:41,920
Sit down.

123
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:55,520
Tell me,

124
00:10:56,520 --> 00:10:58,360
when did your mom pass away?

125
00:11:02,560 --> 00:11:03,640
Back in high school.

126
00:11:04,880 --> 00:11:05,840
That young?

127
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,240
It must've been hard.

128
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:11,840
I made it through.

129
00:11:17,520 --> 00:11:19,480
Your father raised you well.

130
00:11:22,160 --> 00:11:23,119
Wei-zhe also lost

131
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:25,880
his father at around the same age.

132
00:11:27,400 --> 00:11:29,200
After I got sick,

133
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:32,400
he was the one who took care of me.

134
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:37,000
I want to go back.

135
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:41,880
My wife is different from Mei-ling.

136
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:44,160
She needs me.

137
00:11:46,800 --> 00:11:48,120
I have a daughter,

138
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:49,920
and my dad too.

139
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:52,880
They all need me.

140
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:55,440
I have to go back.

141
00:11:58,920 --> 00:11:59,920
Can you help me?

142
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:07,560
I'm sorry on Wei-zhe's behalf.

143
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:11,560
He shouldn't have been selfish.

144
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:15,880
I failed as a parent.

145
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:28,400
There's something

146
00:12:29,640 --> 00:12:31,440
Wei-zhe didn't tell Mei-ling.

147
00:12:32,640 --> 00:12:34,560
It's about the mirror.

148
00:12:38,520 --> 00:12:39,360
What is it?

149
00:12:40,920 --> 00:12:43,000
Promise to help me first,

150
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:45,560
and I'll tell you.

151
00:12:49,880 --> 00:12:50,760
Are

152
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:54,479
Sandy and Kate his sisters?
Older or younger?

153
00:12:54,480 --> 00:12:56,160
I saw their group chat.

154
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:57,840
You know,

155
00:12:58,600 --> 00:13:02,079
my sister left home when we were young
because my dad beat her.

156
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:03,280
Wanted to find her.

157
00:13:04,040 --> 00:13:05,760
Sandy's photo looks

158
00:13:06,280 --> 00:13:07,560
a little like my sister.

159
00:13:08,880 --> 00:13:10,239
I know

160
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,919
they're all in the U.S.

161
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:13,840
I could tell from the group chat.

162
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:17,160
Why are our fates so different?

163
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:21,400
What about you?

164
00:13:21,880 --> 00:13:23,040
Parents?

165
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:24,640
Siblings?

166
00:13:28,160 --> 00:13:29,400
No…

167
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:32,159
If I meet

168
00:13:32,160 --> 00:13:34,199
them someday, I need to know how to act.

169
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:35,800
Give me a heads-up.

170
00:13:39,880 --> 00:13:40,800
Okay,

171
00:13:43,760 --> 00:13:44,680
then…

172
00:13:46,240 --> 00:13:47,120
new topic.

173
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:53,440
Maybe I'll keep you here

174
00:13:56,680 --> 00:13:58,280
as my consultant.

175
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:01,680
I'll hide you

176
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:05,800
from my wife,

177
00:14:08,880 --> 00:14:10,840
deepen the basement,

178
00:14:12,040 --> 00:14:13,440
and soundproof it.

179
00:14:14,800 --> 00:14:16,799
I'll come see you

180
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:17,880
whenever I miss you.

181
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:26,160
I'm kidding.

182
00:14:26,920 --> 00:14:28,560
I learned that from TV, okay?

183
00:14:29,360 --> 00:14:31,279
What did you do to Jian-cheng?

184
00:14:31,280 --> 00:14:32,600
Where is he?

185
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:36,520
Okay,

186
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:38,880
he's at my house.

187
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:41,799
He was fine a few days ago.

188
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:43,079
But when I went there

189
00:14:43,080 --> 00:14:44,399
he was gone.

190
00:14:44,400 --> 00:14:46,800
I don't know if he left on his own

191
00:14:47,760 --> 00:14:49,240
or if my wife got rid of him.

192
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:52,999
No…I was joking.

193
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,359
- My wife wouldn't…
- Don't!

194
00:14:54,360 --> 00:14:55,799
Don't move…

195
00:14:55,800 --> 00:14:57,600
I need some fresh air.

196
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:00,840
Sure,

197
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:03,160
of course.

198
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:10,640
Finish this drink,

199
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:12,240
then we'll go out.

200
00:15:12,920 --> 00:15:13,880
Here,

201
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:16,160
take it.

202
00:15:33,800 --> 00:15:36,079
- Where do you want to go?
- Let me go!

203
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:37,160
Let me go!

204
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:24,840
Dr. Jian.

205
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:27,359
Lee Yun,

206
00:16:27,360 --> 00:16:28,560
why are you here?

207
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:30,080
You're alone?

208
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:34,280
What happened?

209
00:16:37,920 --> 00:16:39,680
He really isn't Jian-cheng.

210
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:45,999
Let's go upstairs.

211
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:47,839
Tell me inside, okay?

212
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:48,959
Give me your phone.

213
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:50,399
I need to warn

214
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:51,999
my daughter and father-in-law.

215
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:53,040
Give me your phone.

216
00:16:55,400 --> 00:16:57,999
No, I can't call them.

217
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:00,519
If he finds out, he'll hurt them.

218
00:17:00,520 --> 00:17:02,559
No, I can't.

219
00:17:02,560 --> 00:17:03,560
Okay, it's alright.

220
00:17:05,520 --> 00:17:06,879
Let's call Jian-cheng.

221
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:08,559
You won't find him.

222
00:17:08,560 --> 00:17:10,279
It won't be him who answers.

223
00:17:10,280 --> 00:17:11,720
He's gone from this world.

224
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:15,000
I don't know where he went.

225
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:19,160
I'm going to call him anyway.

226
00:17:20,040 --> 00:17:20,920
If

227
00:17:21,839 --> 00:17:23,280
it's not Jian-cheng,

228
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:26,400
we'll find a way, okay?

229
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:46,880
Lee Yun!

230
00:17:48,800 --> 00:17:49,720
Lee Yun!

231
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:08,520
Why did you ask me to come?

232
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:15,240
They often come to this cafe.

233
00:18:21,080 --> 00:18:23,319
Dr. Sun prescribed An-an

234
00:18:23,320 --> 00:18:24,680
antihistamines.

235
00:18:26,440 --> 00:18:27,600
They're for allergies.

236
00:18:29,360 --> 00:18:32,320
Yes, it helps An-an's itching.

237
00:18:33,320 --> 00:18:35,679
Dr. Sun usually prescribes

238
00:18:35,680 --> 00:18:37,760
seizure medicine for unexplained cases,

239
00:18:38,520 --> 00:18:40,560
but An-an was different.

240
00:18:45,320 --> 00:18:47,120
My daughter said

241
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:51,119
a classmate faked seizures

242
00:18:51,120 --> 00:18:52,600
to skip school.

243
00:18:54,120 --> 00:18:55,440
Later, the doctor found out

244
00:18:56,320 --> 00:18:57,440
he was faking it.

245
00:18:58,760 --> 00:19:00,920
Kids know how to manipulate adults.

246
00:19:01,720 --> 00:19:02,800
You mean

247
00:19:03,800 --> 00:19:04,840
An-an is pretending?

248
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:06,280
I didn't say that.

249
00:19:09,680 --> 00:19:10,680
I just know

250
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:13,560
whenever you bring An-an
in looking miserable,

251
00:19:15,120 --> 00:19:17,400
Dr. Sun knows you two fought again.

252
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:22,440
He's always in a great mood that night.

253
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:50,119
Why are you telling me this?

254
00:19:50,120 --> 00:19:51,840
Please tell your wife this:

255
00:19:52,920 --> 00:19:55,080
she was just there at the right time.

256
00:19:56,160 --> 00:19:58,239
She isn't special to Dr. Sun.

257
00:19:58,240 --> 00:20:00,439
He's chased many women before.

258
00:20:00,440 --> 00:20:01,920
She's only one of them.

259
00:20:03,760 --> 00:20:06,080
Sun Rong-guang only loves himself.

260
00:20:12,040 --> 00:20:13,440
Tell her yourself.

261
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:18,520
How can you not care?

262
00:20:19,800 --> 00:20:21,320
No one can help me.

263
00:21:57,920 --> 00:21:59,200
Mei-ling.

264
00:23:01,880 --> 00:23:03,200
You're wearing my pajamas?

265
00:23:04,200 --> 00:23:05,960
You slept with my wife, right?

266
00:23:24,520 --> 00:23:25,559
Where's Lee Yun?

267
00:23:25,560 --> 00:23:26,840
Did you hurt her?

268
00:23:27,520 --> 00:23:28,680
He can't hear you.

269
00:23:30,360 --> 00:23:31,280
Mei-ling,

270
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:33,840
Hong Mei-ling!

271
00:23:57,240 --> 00:23:58,480
It's still closed.

272
00:23:59,840 --> 00:24:00,720
Mom.

273
00:24:05,200 --> 00:24:06,400
An-an, what happened?

274
00:24:07,680 --> 00:24:09,360
Are you two fighting?

275
00:24:10,120 --> 00:24:12,000
I heard Dad talking really loudly.

276
00:24:13,000 --> 00:24:14,920
No, we're not fighting.

277
00:24:15,920 --> 00:24:16,840
We're not fighting.

278
00:24:17,760 --> 00:24:20,360
I heard scary noises.

279
00:24:21,240 --> 00:24:23,360
Can you sleep with me?

280
00:24:25,160 --> 00:24:26,479
Okay, come on.

281
00:24:26,480 --> 00:24:28,559
I'll take you back to bed. Let's go.

282
00:24:28,560 --> 00:24:29,480
Dad!

283
00:25:05,760 --> 00:25:07,600
Crack open. Why won't you crack?

284
00:25:10,000 --> 00:25:12,119
If you don't, how will my mom make it?

285
00:25:12,120 --> 00:25:14,360
How will my wife and my son come through?

286
00:25:17,720 --> 00:25:18,999
No…

287
00:25:19,000 --> 00:25:20,720
you can't stay closed.

288
00:25:34,800 --> 00:25:36,280
Or do you think

289
00:25:36,840 --> 00:25:38,400
my wife shouldn't come over?

290
00:25:42,680 --> 00:25:43,640
That can't be.

291
00:25:45,480 --> 00:25:46,400
Can it?

292
00:25:50,240 --> 00:25:51,240
Okay,

293
00:25:52,760 --> 00:25:54,320
I know you're upset.

294
00:25:55,440 --> 00:25:57,479
If I did something

295
00:25:57,480 --> 00:25:58,800
that upset you,

296
00:25:59,560 --> 00:26:00,879
I'm sorry.

297
00:26:00,880 --> 00:26:01,800
I apologize.

298
00:26:04,400 --> 00:26:05,320
Then I'm going to

299
00:26:07,760 --> 00:26:08,920
take you down now…

300
00:26:09,400 --> 00:26:11,120
Don't be mad, okay?

301
00:29:00,280 --> 00:29:01,120
Morning.

302
00:29:02,640 --> 00:29:03,480
Morning.

303
00:29:06,520 --> 00:29:08,320
- There's something…
- Great choice.

304
00:29:09,200 --> 00:29:10,599
My favorite lipstick…

305
00:29:10,600 --> 00:29:11,800
and the priciest one too.

306
00:29:13,200 --> 00:29:14,999
I can't pay you back right now.

307
00:29:15,000 --> 00:29:16,960
Your husband would have to pay.

308
00:29:17,480 --> 00:29:19,039
His phone showed two accounts

309
00:29:19,040 --> 00:29:20,999
with only a little over 3,000 combined.

310
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:22,039
Another account

311
00:29:22,040 --> 00:29:24,119
gets regular insurance payments.

312
00:29:24,120 --> 00:29:26,039
Probably his mother's insurance money.

313
00:29:26,040 --> 00:29:28,239
- What's your monthly…
- Wife never told you?

314
00:29:28,240 --> 00:29:29,999
You're boring when silent

315
00:29:30,000 --> 00:29:31,920
and annoying when you talk.

316
00:29:37,280 --> 00:29:40,720
You think those words
would make her listen?

317
00:29:41,480 --> 00:29:42,520
I had to try, right?

318
00:29:43,960 --> 00:29:44,880
You left it.

319
00:29:46,920 --> 00:29:48,040
You'll help me?

320
00:29:48,680 --> 00:29:50,240
I don't know what else I can do.

321
00:29:52,040 --> 00:29:53,720
I told you everything.

322
00:30:16,840 --> 00:30:17,800
You know?

323
00:30:18,440 --> 00:30:20,320
Yoo-shin only eats plain steamed buns.

324
00:30:21,320 --> 00:30:23,040
He won't eat them

325
00:30:24,160 --> 00:30:25,240
if anything is added.

326
00:30:44,120 --> 00:30:45,479
Your son…

327
00:30:45,480 --> 00:30:47,400
disappeared at the mountain pavilion?

328
00:30:49,960 --> 00:30:51,120
Wei-zhe told me.

329
00:30:52,560 --> 00:30:54,440
He searched through your house

330
00:30:55,840 --> 00:30:57,759
and saw the newspaper clippings

331
00:30:57,760 --> 00:30:59,240
you put up…

332
00:31:01,320 --> 00:31:02,400
My wife made it.

333
00:31:04,120 --> 00:31:07,600
She collected every news report
about Yoo-shin.

334
00:31:09,040 --> 00:31:10,519
I couldn't bear seeing

335
00:31:10,520 --> 00:31:11,679
her look at them,

336
00:31:11,680 --> 00:31:13,040
so I put them all away.

337
00:31:13,840 --> 00:31:15,280
She didn't eat or

338
00:31:16,240 --> 00:31:17,520
speak to me for days.

339
00:31:22,840 --> 00:31:24,000
Could your son

340
00:31:25,920 --> 00:31:26,920
be here?

341
00:31:28,360 --> 00:31:31,400
Is there another portal in the mountains?

342
00:31:32,400 --> 00:31:34,400
I checked the news from three years ago.

343
00:31:35,400 --> 00:31:36,800
Nothing about Yoo-shin.

344
00:31:38,480 --> 00:31:41,240
Local news doesn't always make it online.

345
00:31:46,480 --> 00:31:47,360
I'll…

346
00:31:49,760 --> 00:31:51,280
ask someone to find out.

347
00:31:59,760 --> 00:32:00,680
Thank you.

348
00:32:12,200 --> 00:32:13,080
Mei-ling,

349
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:22,120
how did Wei-zhe's father die?

350
00:32:26,400 --> 00:32:27,520
A heart attack.

351
00:32:28,160 --> 00:32:29,879
Wei-zhe told me

352
00:32:29,880 --> 00:32:32,999
that one day, my mother-in-law
went to wake him up for dinner,

353
00:32:33,000 --> 00:32:35,000
but he was lying in bed completely still.

354
00:32:35,680 --> 00:32:37,920
Wei-zhe came home from school and realized

355
00:32:38,600 --> 00:32:39,760
something was wrong.

356
00:33:08,240 --> 00:33:10,439
Jian-cheng, why won't you answer?

357
00:33:10,440 --> 00:33:12,440
I'm worried about Lee Yun.

358
00:33:13,200 --> 00:33:15,360
Can you come tomorrow morning?

359
00:33:21,240 --> 00:33:23,439
Jian-cheng, why won't you answer?

360
00:33:23,440 --> 00:33:25,400
I'm worried about Lee Yun.

361
00:33:26,200 --> 00:33:28,560
Can you come tomorrow morning?

362
00:33:39,800 --> 00:33:40,720
Come in.

363
00:33:56,240 --> 00:33:57,160
What happened?

364
00:34:01,280 --> 00:34:03,680
Lee Yun didn't tell you what she did?

365
00:34:05,200 --> 00:34:06,639
She came last night.

366
00:34:06,640 --> 00:34:08,000
She wasn't doing well.

367
00:34:11,000 --> 00:34:12,040
Mine's worse, right?

368
00:34:14,000 --> 00:34:15,440
What exactly happened?

369
00:34:36,320 --> 00:34:38,238
Do you know where she is?

370
00:34:38,239 --> 00:34:39,320
No idea.

371
00:34:41,199 --> 00:34:42,480
Why did you call me?

372
00:34:44,719 --> 00:34:47,000
She says you're not Jian-cheng.

373
00:34:59,200 --> 00:35:00,080
What do you think?

374
00:35:09,120 --> 00:35:10,080
Sorry.

375
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:13,239
No sleep last night.

376
00:35:13,240 --> 00:35:14,920
I can't think clearly right now.

377
00:35:18,280 --> 00:35:20,200
She hit me with a glass and bit me.

378
00:35:22,560 --> 00:35:23,960
She's never done this before.

379
00:35:25,000 --> 00:35:27,599
If you find her, call me right away.

380
00:35:27,600 --> 00:35:29,679
If her condition keeps getting worse,

381
00:35:29,680 --> 00:35:31,800
I'll have to admit her to the hospital.

382
00:35:47,440 --> 00:35:49,039
The location is great,

383
00:35:49,040 --> 00:35:50,879
and the floor-to-ceiling windows

384
00:35:50,880 --> 00:35:52,200
give it great lighting.

385
00:35:55,160 --> 00:35:56,479
She used to teach kids.

386
00:35:56,480 --> 00:35:58,239
There are no partitions,

387
00:35:58,240 --> 00:35:59,479
so it's spacious.

388
00:35:59,480 --> 00:36:01,239
The kids could run around.

389
00:36:01,240 --> 00:36:02,519
It's open and spacious,

390
00:36:02,520 --> 00:36:03,880
with a storage room too.

391
00:36:07,320 --> 00:36:08,160
Sister-in-law.

392
00:36:12,480 --> 00:36:13,920
The back window

393
00:36:15,000 --> 00:36:16,720
was left open last time,

394
00:36:18,320 --> 00:36:19,680
so I got in that way.

395
00:36:22,640 --> 00:36:23,840
But I…

396
00:36:24,920 --> 00:36:26,720
I can't stay here forever.

397
00:36:29,840 --> 00:36:31,359
I have to find a way home.

398
00:36:31,360 --> 00:36:32,639
I need to go home.

399
00:36:32,640 --> 00:36:33,719
Mirror has to crack,

400
00:36:33,720 --> 00:36:35,120
so Jian-cheng can return.

401
00:36:36,960 --> 00:36:38,480
He'll come back, right?

402
00:36:39,880 --> 00:36:40,720
Da-jun,

403
00:36:41,360 --> 00:36:42,480
help me.

404
00:36:44,120 --> 00:36:45,359
Sister-in-law,

405
00:36:45,360 --> 00:36:46,720
how can I help?

406
00:36:47,600 --> 00:36:48,719
Let's find Jian-cheng

407
00:36:48,720 --> 00:36:50,559
and talk this through.

408
00:36:50,560 --> 00:36:52,879
He's not Jian-cheng, Da-jun.

409
00:36:52,880 --> 00:36:54,640
He's pretending to be Jian-cheng.

410
00:36:55,680 --> 00:36:57,480
Don't you think he's acting strange?

411
00:36:58,200 --> 00:36:59,560
Can't you see it?

412
00:37:02,000 --> 00:37:03,120
Da-jun?

413
00:37:05,800 --> 00:37:06,720
Sister-in-law,

414
00:37:07,960 --> 00:37:08,880
I'm sorry.

415
00:37:10,120 --> 00:37:11,120
What do you mean?

416
00:37:13,240 --> 00:37:14,240
What are you doing?

417
00:37:22,160 --> 00:37:23,160
Da-jun…

418
00:37:43,560 --> 00:37:44,480
no.

419
00:37:46,280 --> 00:37:47,200
Brother…

420
00:37:47,760 --> 00:37:48,679
- your leg.
- Fine.

421
00:37:48,680 --> 00:37:49,960
Don't ask.

422
00:37:51,120 --> 00:37:52,280
Come home with me?

423
00:37:52,920 --> 00:37:54,440
I looked everywhere.

424
00:37:55,240 --> 00:37:56,320
I was worried.

425
00:38:00,200 --> 00:38:01,119
It's fine now.

426
00:38:01,120 --> 00:38:02,479
- She's safe.
- It's fine.

427
00:38:02,480 --> 00:38:04,360
- Don't be angry.
- Really, it's fine.

428
00:38:07,280 --> 00:38:08,200
Really, it's fine.

429
00:38:13,200 --> 00:38:15,239
Yu-jhen called.

430
00:38:15,240 --> 00:38:17,480
She's worried because you won't reply.

431
00:38:19,160 --> 00:38:20,280
Your phone's in my car,

432
00:38:21,560 --> 00:38:22,800
text her back.

433
00:38:29,200 --> 00:38:30,120
Did you forget?

434
00:38:31,240 --> 00:38:32,479
The last time

435
00:38:32,480 --> 00:38:33,680
you disappeared,

436
00:38:34,440 --> 00:38:35,919
Yu-jhen was so worried

437
00:38:35,920 --> 00:38:37,800
that she skipped class and rushed home.

438
00:38:38,520 --> 00:38:39,800
You don't want that, huh?

439
00:38:59,400 --> 00:39:00,320
Da-jun,

440
00:39:00,520 --> 00:39:01,440
thanks.

441
00:39:03,000 --> 00:39:04,160
it's nothing.

442
00:39:05,480 --> 00:39:06,559
I wouldn't

443
00:39:06,560 --> 00:39:08,519
have found her without you.

444
00:39:08,520 --> 00:39:09,879
Come visit soon.

445
00:39:09,880 --> 00:39:10,960
You have to.

446
00:39:12,600 --> 00:39:13,920
Brother…your leg…

447
00:39:20,160 --> 00:39:21,080
Get in.

448
00:39:38,920 --> 00:39:39,840
Password?

449
00:39:41,840 --> 00:39:42,760
I don't know.

450
00:39:48,320 --> 00:39:51,000
His phone has
six password-protected accounts.

451
00:40:03,480 --> 00:40:04,800
I didn't want to tell you,

452
00:40:06,440 --> 00:40:09,600
but Jian-cheng is seeing another woman.

453
00:40:15,200 --> 00:40:16,160
Jian-cheng wouldn't.

454
00:40:18,120 --> 00:40:19,719
I saw it in the mirror.

455
00:40:19,720 --> 00:40:20,919
At first,

456
00:40:20,920 --> 00:40:23,160
I didn't know what it was showing me.

457
00:40:24,920 --> 00:40:26,560
Then I saw your psychiatrist.

458
00:40:29,640 --> 00:40:31,679
I realized she was the one Jian-cheng

459
00:40:31,680 --> 00:40:32,760
had always wanted.

460
00:40:34,480 --> 00:40:36,240
She slept with him.

461
00:40:41,600 --> 00:40:42,520
And she wants

462
00:40:43,960 --> 00:40:45,960
to put you in a psychiatric hospital.

463
00:40:52,400 --> 00:40:53,360
I don't believe it.

464
00:40:55,560 --> 00:40:56,520
Honestly,

465
00:40:57,360 --> 00:40:58,840
believe me or don't.

466
00:40:59,760 --> 00:41:01,840
The mirror didn't crack.

467
00:41:02,560 --> 00:41:03,880
What if it never does?

468
00:41:06,800 --> 00:41:08,520
You'll be with me forever.

469
00:41:12,120 --> 00:41:13,040
Password.

470
00:41:49,240 --> 00:41:52,560
You can try again in 24 hours,

471
00:41:53,560 --> 00:41:55,840
or get a new one from the bank.

472
00:42:03,440 --> 00:42:04,440
There are six more.

473
00:42:06,400 --> 00:42:08,400
I have all the time in the world.

474
00:42:27,520 --> 00:42:29,000
Have you decided?

475
00:42:31,120 --> 00:42:33,279
Just take me to

476
00:42:33,280 --> 00:42:35,600
- that intersection like last time…
- I can't.

477
00:42:38,040 --> 00:42:39,360
If I can't return,

478
00:42:41,280 --> 00:42:43,560
I'll get you a 24-hour caregiver.

479
00:42:44,520 --> 00:42:46,000
You'll be well taken care of.

480
00:42:46,600 --> 00:42:48,400
Or you can go to a care facility.

481
00:42:49,040 --> 00:42:51,000
I promise you'll live comfortably.

482
00:42:57,120 --> 00:42:58,360
You caused Wei-zhe's

483
00:43:00,200 --> 00:43:01,640
father's death, didn't you?

484
00:43:08,880 --> 00:43:10,200
The mirror told me.

485
00:43:11,640 --> 00:43:13,320
Mei-ling and An-an deserve

486
00:43:14,560 --> 00:43:15,959
to know the truth

487
00:43:15,960 --> 00:43:17,439
about his father.

488
00:43:17,440 --> 00:43:18,920
"The mirror told you"?

489
00:43:21,200 --> 00:43:22,520
Is that a threat?

490
00:43:25,200 --> 00:43:27,560
I thought you were honest.

491
00:43:49,240 --> 00:43:50,200
Jian-cheng!

492
00:43:52,000 --> 00:43:53,000
Jian-cheng!

493
00:44:00,720 --> 00:44:02,239
Didn't I tell you

494
00:44:02,240 --> 00:44:03,240
not to lock the door?

495
00:44:08,120 --> 00:44:09,200
Why do this again?

496
00:44:13,960 --> 00:44:14,960
What do you mean?

497
00:44:16,480 --> 00:44:18,240
Is this a negotiation?

498
00:44:21,320 --> 00:44:23,480
Jian-cheng!

499
00:44:31,120 --> 00:44:35,479
- Jian-cheng!
- Stop calling Jian-cheng!

500
00:44:35,480 --> 00:44:36,399
Am I not good?

501
00:44:36,400 --> 00:44:37,519
- Not enough?
- Honey!

502
00:44:37,520 --> 00:44:39,519
Am I not good?

503
00:44:39,520 --> 00:44:40,559
You wanna go?

504
00:44:40,560 --> 00:44:41,559
- Honey!
- You do?

505
00:44:41,560 --> 00:44:44,320
Fine. I'll help you. Go!

506
00:45:11,760 --> 00:45:12,680
Lee Yun?

507
00:45:16,080 --> 00:45:17,000
Lee Yun!

508
00:45:18,280 --> 00:45:19,200
Lee Yun.

509
00:45:20,240 --> 00:45:21,160
Lee Yun.

510
00:45:21,800 --> 00:45:22,720
Lee Yun.

511
00:45:32,080 --> 00:45:33,000
Lee Yun!
